Value Filldown METRIC (Temperature|Voltage|Transmit Power|Receive Power|Current)
Value Required INTERFACE (\w+\d+/\S+)
Value Filldown UNIT (Celsius|Volts|dBm|mA)
Value VALUE ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value HIGH_ALARM ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value HIGH_WARNING ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value LOW_WARNING ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value LOW_ALARM ([-+]?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^\s+${METRIC}\s+Threshold
  ^Port\s+\(${UNIT}\)
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${VALUE}\s+[+\-]*\s*${HIGH_ALARM}\s+${HIGH_WARNING}\s+${LOW_WARNING}\s+${LOW_ALARM}\s*$$ -> Record
